                        ["en"] = "Definitions Website User (hereinafter referred to as the User) – a person who has access to the Website via the Internet and uses the Website. Website Administration (hereinafter referred to as the Website Administration) – authorized employees managing the Website, who organize and/or process personal data, as well as determine the purposes of personal data processing, the scope of personal data to be processed, and the actions (operations) performed with personal data. General Provisions These Website Terms and Conditions (hereinafter referred to as the Terms) constitute a public agreement between the company owner in the form of a limited liability company and each registered user of our service. By using our Website, you understand and agree to these Terms and Conditions in their entirety, as well as the rules and conditions outlined in each section. Please do not use the Website if you do not agree with these Terms. Rules The information posted on the Website may only be used subject to compliance with all requirements, so please carefully read the terms of use (hereinafter referred to as the Rules). Each Party guarantees to the other Party that it possesses the necessary legal capacity and competence. Intellectual Property All textual information and graphic images contained on this Website are the property of the Seller and its counterparties. Trademarks, trade names, and logos posted on the Website are the property of their respective owners. Users may view and download materials from this Website solely for personal, non-commercial use, provided that all copyright information and other proprietary notices contained in the original materials and any copies thereof are preserved. It is prohibited to modify the materials of this Website, as well as to distribute or display them in any form or use them in any other way for public or commercial purposes. Any use of these materials on other websites or in computer networks is prohibited. Links to Other Websites Links to other resources (websites) provided on this Website are intended solely for informational purposes. The Website Administration bears no responsibility for any damages or losses that may be incurred as a result of accessing websites linked from this Website. Changes The Website Administration reserves the right, at its sole discretion, to make changes, amendments, additions, or deletions to any sections of this Agreement, in whole or in part, at any time. Changes to the Agreement will take effect after a notice of such changes is posted on the Website. Your continued use of the Website after the posting of a notice of changes to the Agreement signifies your acceptance of those changes. The Website Administration may, at any time without prior notice, cancel, modify, correct any errors or omissions in any section of the Website, as well as make other changes to the Website’s materials, post information about products or prices (if applicable), suspend or terminate the operation of various sections of the Website, including access to certain features of the Website. The Website Administration may also impose restrictions on certain features and services or limit your access to specific sections of the Website or the entire Website without notice or liability on its part. Security You must not: – use any devices or software that may interfere with the Website’s operation; – perform any actions that result in the Website’s infrastructure being subjected to a disproportionately large or unreasonable load (e.g., sending mass emails – “spam”); – interfere with the operation of the Website’s software or its functional elements, including posting materials infected with viruses, malicious programs such as “Trojan horses,” “time bombs,” or other elements that may harm the Website’s software structure or affect its operation. Notifications All references to “letters,” “notifications,” and other similar terms refer to electronic means of