                        ["en"] = "This privacy policy describes what personal data we collect, how we use, store, and protect it, and what rights users have regarding their data. It applies to all users of the dobrodiy website and application. What data we collect how we use your data data storage and protection data sharing your rights changes to the policy contact information what data we collect we may collect the following information: first name, last name, or nickname email address phone number account information (username, password) selected role (adopter, volunteer, donor) preferences (e.g., saved animals, application history) communication with administration (requests, messages) technical device data: type, ip address, os version, etc. How we use your data creating and managing your account processing adoption, volunteer, or donation requests sending important information (e.g., request status) improving app functionality and user experience sending news updates, with your consent data storage and protection all personal data is stored encrypted on secure servers we apply technical and organizational measures to prevent unauthorized access access to personal data is granted only to authorized shelter staff or technical support data sharing we do not share your personal data with third parties, except as required by law or with your explicit consent. Your rights you have the right to: access your personal data correct or update it delete your account and all stored data opt out of informational messages to exercise any of these rights, please contact us using the information below. Changes to the policy we may periodically update this policy. All changes are published on this page, and the effective date is listed above. Your data is safe. We care about your trust as much as we care for our furry friends.",
